tps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450170/extras/e6a07e0c1eb178c802df0ed9b88200ea.webm?t=1616655976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450170/extras/e6a07e0c1eb178c802df0ed9b88200ea.mp4?t=1616655976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Game Features]</h2>1. Tropical island style of enviroment<br><br>2. Day and night changes in the game<br><br>3. Over 30 exquisite CG paintings<br><br>4. 7 different endings<br><br>5. Funny side story &amp; funny NPC<br><br>We\u2019ve been working hard to bring more multi-line of the story to our audience, please stay tuned for our upcoming updates, thanks.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450170/extras/733e1a31f40ba23c14468f24dcca5142.poster.avif?t=1616655976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450170/extras/733e1a31f40ba23c14468f24dcca5142.webm?t=1616655976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450170/extras/733e1a31f40ba23c14468f24dcca5142.mp4?t=1616655976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Background]</h2>The story takes place on a tropical island named \u201cHighland Island\u201d, where the Middle Age Devil died.<br>My travel gets really SPECIAL because of this mysterious island.<br>After everything shows me that I\u2019m the son of the Devil, what I should do with my POWER? to conquer the world? or end my single life?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450170/extras/e6a07e0c1eb178c802df0ed9b88200ea.poster.avif?t=1616655976\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450170/extras/e6a07e0c1eb178c802df0ed9b88200ea.webm?t=1616655976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450170/extras/e6a07e0c1eb178c802df0ed9b88200ea.mp4?t=1616655976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Game Features]</h2>1. Tropical island style of enviroment<br><br>2. Day and night changes in the game<br><br>3. Over 30 exquisite CG paintings<br><br>4. 7 different endings<br><br>5. Funny side story &amp; funny NPC<br><br>We\u2019ve been working hard to bring more multi-line of the story to our audience, please stay tuned for our upcoming updates, thanks.",
